<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Portuguese as written in Brazil. Everyday words, as banking and budgeting apps use them,
    rather than literal ones. The reader is addressed as "você".

    Glossary (keep these the same everywhere):
        transaction        transação            expense    despesa        income    receita
        spending           gastos               balance    saldo          amount    valor
        savings / saved    economia / economizado                         note      nota
        category           categoria            settings   Ajustes (the phone's own: configurações)
        backup / restore   backup / restaurar   export     exportação, exportar
        delete             excluir              save       salvar         cancel    cancelar
        undo               desfazer             search     buscar         title     título
        bill (scanned)     comprovante          app lock   bloqueio do app
        screen lock        bloqueio de tela     built-in / custom  padrão / personalizada

    Kept as they are: CSV, Excel, Google Sheets, cashback, freelance, app and the app's name.

    Numbers use Western digits. Not here on purpose: strings marked translatable="false"
    in values/strings.xml, which read the same in every language.
-->
